※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4408 LANG_TYPEDEF_CONTAINS_ITSELF

※ A product holds its fields and a sum holds one of its variants, so a type
※ that reaches itself through either would need room for a value of itself
※ inside a value of itself, without end.  What makes such a shape possible
※ elsewhere is an indirection, and the language has no way to write one.
※ A chain through several definitions counts as much as a direct one.

type Chain = next : Link
type Link = back : Chain

@[startup]
fn main() → u8:
    0u8
